1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,520
Already have a MetaTrader expert? ActFX can convert it for you.

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:10,630
On the ActFX tab, click MQL to ActFX.

3
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:18,560
Pick your .mq4 or .mq5 file with Select File, or paste the code here.

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,220
Give the new strategy a name.

5
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:27,350
Click Convert. The result is saved to your strategy library.

6
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:31,210
Your converted strategy is listed under My Strategies.

7
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:36,520
Click Edit to open the converted code.

8
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:41,380
Check it over. Settings you could change in MetaTrader are kept as settings here.

9
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:46,200
Click Compile to check it is ready to run.

10
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:50,200
No errors, so you can test it or run it like any other strategy.

